  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While refining in Star Form blessed land, Fang Yuan names the four publicly recognized strongest immortal killer moves that can process difficult immortal materials instantly: slumbering lightning python, reflect snow, muffled thunder stone drum, and wind grind. He does not have any of the four, so earthly limit astral qi costs him long effort instead.",
      "chapters": [
        861
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_star_form_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On True Yang mountain range, Yu Mu Chun gathers five or six tornadoes into one huge tornado and flicks an earthly limit astral qi pearl into it. The tornado digests the pearl in fifteen minutes, dyeing the wind pillar black and white. Ben Duo Yi asks whether the move is the legendary wind grind; Yu Mu Chun confirms that it is. Immortal essence stones tossed afterward are ground to dust in an instant by blades of wind.",
      "chapters": [
        861
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_true_yang_mountain_range",
        "char_yu_mu_chun",
        "sys_immortal_essence_stone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Four Elements Square Regret Blood Refinement Pool can utilize this refinement path killer move among others, including slumbering lightning python, reflect snow, muffled thunder stone drum, dragon-shaped blizzard, refinement snake lifespan flower, heavenly light ring, and omnipresent four seas.",
